   "summary": "This document is a comprehensive statistical roster of educational institutions across Iwate Prefecture, Japan, organized by administrative authority (Ministry of Education, prefectural, municipal, and town or village). It reports founding dates, male and female student enrollments, and teaching staff numbers for both April 30 and November 30, 1946. Institutions listed include colleges, normal schools, middle schools, girls' high schools, vocational schools, youth schools, and elementary schools.",
